              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "trips"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new trip. Protected — organizer is taken from the token. Test script auto-saves `tripId`.\n\n**Validation:** `startDate` must be today or future, `endDate` after `startDate`, `maxParticipants` 2–50, `mode` (Bus/Train/Car/Flight), `type` (Adventure/Leisure/Cultural/Educational)."
          }
        },
